<title>JAPAN: Dollar down vs yen, trade subdued in late Tokyo.</title>
<headline>Dollar down vs yen, trade subdued in late Tokyo.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>0634 GMT	    TRADED HIGH/LOW AS OF 0600 GMT</p>
<p> USD/JPY     113.98/08		114.89-113.99</p>
<p> USD/DEM     1.7356/61		1.7378-1.7337</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The dollar was easier against the yen in late Tokyo on Monday after speculative sales by U.S. operators took the dollar down towards 114 yen in the morning.</p>
<p>Afternoon trade was subdued amid a lack of fresh factors, but buying interest on dips and talk of bids from Japanese public funds kept the dollar's downside solid near 114 yen for most of the Asian session, dealers said.</p>
